      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am so sorry you are feeling this heavy, and it is okay to feel despair when the final loss leaves you with no one left to care for. Please know that you do not have to carry this alone, even if you don't want a support group, and you can seek help from a trauma therapist or hospice social worker to talk to a professional. You deserve to have your pain heard and tended to so that you can feel some relief.",
